OL,6,CG1936FGardening Demonstration: Autumn 
OL,7,FPruning airs on BBC TV. Cecil Henry    
OL,8,FMiddleton presents the first TV        
OL,9,Fgardening programme from a             
OL,10,Fpurpose-built garden at Alexandra      
OL,11,FPalace.                                
OL,13,CG1969FThe first episode of Curry and  
OL,14,FChips airs on ITV.                     
OL,16,CG1979FThe first episode of The Racing 
OL,17,FGame airs on ITV.                      
