OL,6,CG1980FChildren in Need is televised   
OL,7,Ffor the first time - on BBC One. From  
OL,8,F1984, the annual TV event would run    
OL,9,Ffrom the early evening until the early 
OL,10,Fhours of the morning.                  
OL,12,CG1984FThe first episode of The Box of 
OL,13,FDelights airs on BBC One.              
OL,15,CG1985FThe final episode of Happy      
OL,16,FFamilies airs on BBC One.              
OL,18,CG1988FThe final episode of Wyatt's    
OL,19,FWatchdog airs on BBC One.              
